{"t_ms": 645500, "conversation_id": "conv_sentence_end_s0_034", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Steam Room Guidelines\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe steam room is available daily from 7:00 AM to 9:00 PM. Guests should limit each session to 15\u201320 minutes for maximum comfort. Individuals with heart conditions, high blood pressure, or other medical concerns are advised to consult a healthcare professional before using the facility.", "# corpus/ \u2014 Hotel Documents\n\n**Owner: Lakshya**\n\n## What this folder is\n\nThe hotel's documents live here: the knowledge the assistant answers from. About 60 short \ndocuments covering things like pool and gym hours, check-in and check-out rules, menus, and \npolicies.\n\n## How to fill it\n\nSee the full instructions in `retrieval/README.md` (Step 1). In short:\n- Write ~60 short documents, one topic per file, as `.txt` or `.md`.\n- Make them realistic and varied.\n- Deliberately plant a few contradictions (e.g. one doc says the pool closes at 10 PM, \n  another says 9 PM) and keep a note of which ones, for a later experiment.\n\nThe index-building script reads every file in this folder, so anything you put here becomes \npart of the searchable knowledge.\n", "Indoor Games Room\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nGuests can enjoy a variety of indoor recreational activities including table tennis, carrom, chess, billiards, and board games. The Games Room is open daily from 8:00 AM to 10:00 PM. Equipment should be returned after use, and guests are requested to maintain a quiet and respectful environment."], "scores": [0.4949030578136444, 0.708325207233429, 0.7286072373390198], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 1422, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
